{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21032","headline":"新夏歌 · 李贺","name":"新夏歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓木千笼真蜡彩，落蕊枯香数分在。\n阴枝秀牙卷缥茸，长风回气扶葱茏。\n野家麦畦上新壠，长畛裴回桑柘重。\n刺香满地菖蒲草，雨梁燕语悲身老。\n三月摇扬入河道，天浓地浓柳梳扫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21032.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21032","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}